        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Internationale Poster</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --yellow:#f2d24b;\n    --red:#b02418;\n    --dark:#5c1a12;\n  }\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#111;}\n  .poster{\n    position:relative;\n    width:1069px;\n    height:1618px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:var(--yellow);\n    border:12px solid #1a1a1a;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    font-family:\"Courier New\", Courier, monospace;\n  }\n\n  /* Red field on the right/centre */\n  .red-field{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:22px;\n    left:330px;\n    width:718px;\n    height:1215px;\n    background:var(--red);\n    clip-path:polygon(180px 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\n  }\n\n  /* Left column of photo placeholders */\n  .photo-column{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:22px;\n    left:48px;\n    width:420px;\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n  }\n  .placeholder{\n    position:relative;\n    background:var(--dark);\n    color:var(--yellow);\n    border:1px solid #2b0d09;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-end;\n    font-size:15px;\n    letter-spacing:.5px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .placeholder .caption{\n    width:100%;\n    background:var(--yellow);\n    color:#2b0d09;\n    padding:2px 4px;\n    font-family:\"Courier New\", Courier, monospace;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .ph1{width:420px;height:310px;}\n  .ph2{width:420px;height:310px;}\n  .ph3{width:305px;height:290px;}\n  .ph4{width:305px;height:295px;}\n\n  /* Bottom rubble / barricade band */\n  .bottom-scene{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:48px;\n    bottom:22px;\n    width:998px;\n    height:390px;\n    background:var(--yellow);\n    border:1px solid #2b0d09;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-end;\n    color:#2b0d09;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .bottom-scene .caption{\n    padding:2px 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* Text block */\n  .text-block{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:140px;\n    left:540px;\n    width:500px;\n    color:var(--yellow);\n  }\n  h1{\n    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:44px;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    margin:0 0 46px 20px;\n  }\n  .verse{\n    font-size:19px;\n    line-height:1.42;\n    letter-spacing:1.2px;\n    margin:0 0 34px 0;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .indent{ padding-left:74px; display:inline-block; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <div class=\"red-field\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-column\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder ph1\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">1871 Paris Commune</div>\n      <!-- [Photo: top-left, crowd at barricade] -->\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder ph2\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">1889 London Dockers Strike</div>\n      <!-- [Photo: left column, second from top] -->\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder ph3\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">1916 Irish Citizens Army</div>\n      <!-- [Photo: left column, third from top] -->\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder ph4\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">1917 the Red Army, USSR</div>\n      <!-- [Photo: left column, bottom] -->\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"bottom-scene\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n    <div class=\"caption\">1919 the Red Clyde, Glasgow</div>\n    <!-- [Illustration: bottom band, rubble/cobbles with red flag and figures] -->\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <h1>INTERNATIONALE</h1>\n\n    <p class=\"verse\">\n      arise you prisoners of starvation<br>\n      arise you wretched of the earth,<br>\n      for justice thunders condemnation,<br>\n      a better worlds in birth.<br>\n      no more traditions chains shall bind us<br>\n      arise you slaves,no more in thrall<br>\n      the earth shall rise on new foundations<br>\n      we have been naught,we shall,be all.<br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">tis the final conflict,</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">let each stand in his place</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">the internationale</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">shall be the human race.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"verse\">\n      we want no condesending saviours<br>\n      to rule us from their judgement hall<br>\n      we workers ask not for their favours<br>\n      let us consult for all.<br>\n      to make the theif disgorge his booty<br>\n      to free the spirit from its cell<br>\n      we must ourselves decide our duty<br>\n      decide and do it well.<br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">tis the final conflict......</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"verse\">\n      toilers from shop and field united<br>\n      the union of all who work,<br>\n      the earth belongs to us as workers<br>\n      no room for those who shirk.<br>\n      how many on our flesh have fattened<br>\n      but if the bloody birds of prey<br>\n      shall vanish from the sky one morning<br>\n      the golden sun will stay.<br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">tis the final conflict......</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
